From: Erfan Abdi <erfangplus@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] apklayer compat: -std=c++20 for gcc before 11

gcc 10 (Sailfish OS 5.0) knows no c++2b; libstdc++_standalone builds as C++20 there.
Applied by meson.build after gcc-before-13-cxx2b.patch only when the compiler is gcc older than 11.
---
diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -155,7 +155,7 @@ stdcpp_bio = shared_library('stdc++_bio',
 		'libstdc++_standalone/include/'
 	],
 	cpp_args: [
-		'--std=c++2b'
+		'--std=c++20'
 	]
 )
